      "id": 1,
      "text": "Gattman was incorporated in 1890, named for brothers Morris and Jacob Gattman, whose land deals coincided with the railroad that sparked a lumber boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
